{"seq":3,"slug":"mutation-metrics","title":"变异测试指标与改进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-metrics","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"变异测试指标与改进策略\">变异测试指标与改进策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>变异分数 = 被杀死的变异体 / 全部有效变异体。存活变异体是改进测试的直接线索——需要区分等价变异体（不可杀死）、缺少断言（执行了但没验证）、缺少边界测试（未覆盖临界条件）和缺少负路径测试（未验证错误处理）。属性测试是提升变异分数最高效的途径之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变异测试的度量体系\">变异测试的度量体系</h2><p>变异测试产出的不仅是一个数字（变异分数），而是一套完整的质量信号体系。正确解读这些信号是改进测试套件的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>变异体的状态分类</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对测试质量的启示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Killed</td>\n<td>至少一个测试检测到了变异</td>\n<td>测试对该代码点有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Survived</td>\n<td>所有测试通过（未检测到变异）</td>\n<td>测试对该代码点无效或不够精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>No Coverage</td>\n<td>变异点没有被任何测试执行到</td>\n<td>该代码完全未测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Timeout</td>\n<td>变异导致无限循环/超时</td>\n<td>通常视为 Killed（变异被检出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compile Error</td>\n<td>变异导致编译失败</td>\n<td>不计入有效变异体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Runtime Error</td>\n<td>变异导致未被测试断言捕获的错误</td>\n<td>视为 Killed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>核心指标计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mutation Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Killed</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Timeout</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Killed</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Timeout</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Survived</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mutation Score} = \\frac{\\text{Killed} + \\text{Timeout}}{\\text{Killed} + \\text{Timeout} + \\text{Survived}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mutation Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Killed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Timeout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Survived</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Killed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Timeout</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意：No Coverage 和 Compile Error 的变异体不参与分数计算。有些工具还计算一个包含 No Coverage 的更严格版本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mutation Score (strict)</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Killed</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Timeout</mtext></mrow><mtext>Total Valid Mutants</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mutation Score (strict)} = \\frac{\\text{Killed} + \\text{Timeout}}{\\text{Total Valid Mutants}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mutation Score (strict)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Valid Mutants</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Killed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Timeout</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"变异分数的解读基准\">变异分数的解读基准</h2><p>变异分数应该达到多少？这取决于代码的风险等级和项目阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[变异分数区间] --&gt; B[&quot;&lt; 60%: 测试套件薄弱&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;60-75%: 基本覆盖&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;75-85%: 良好水平&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;85-95%: 优秀水平&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;&gt; 95%: 接近理论上限&quot;]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[紧急:核心逻辑可能未被测试保护]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[改进方向明确,关注存活变异]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[多数生产代码的合理目标]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[安全关键代码的推荐目标]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[警惕等价变异体干扰]\">flowchart LR\n    A[变异分数区间] --&gt; B[\"&lt; 60%: 测试套件薄弱\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"60-75%: 基本覆盖\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"75-85%: 良好水平\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"85-95%: 优秀水平\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"&gt; 95%: 接近理论上限\"]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[紧急:核心逻辑可能未被测试保护]\n    C --&gt; C1[改进方向明确,关注存活变异]\n    D --&gt; D1[多数生产代码的合理目标]\n    E --&gt; E1[安全关键代码的推荐目标]\n    F --&gt; F1[警惕等价变异体干扰]</pre><p>经验数据表明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代码类型</th>\n<th>推荐变异分数阈值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全关键（加密、认证）</td>\n<td>≥ 90%</td>\n<td>缺陷代价极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心业务逻辑</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n<td>主要收入/功能路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通业务代码</td>\n<td>≥ 70%</td>\n<td>日常功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具类/辅助代码</td>\n<td>≥ 60%</td>\n<td>低风险、变动少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>胶水代码/配置</td>\n<td>不强制</td>\n<td>投入产出比低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"存活变异体的分析方法\">存活变异体的分析方法</h2><p>存活变异体是改进测试套件的直接线索。对每个存活者需要判断：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 是否为等价变异体？</strong></p>\n<p>如果变异后的代码在语义上与原始代码等价，那么没有测试能杀死它——这不是测试的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 等价变异体示例&#10;# 原始：&#10;for i in range(len(items)):&#10;&#10;# 变异：将 &lt; 替换为 !=（当 i 单调递增时语义等价）&#10;i = 0&#10;while i != len(items):&#10;    i += 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 等价变异体示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原始：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 变异：将 &#x3C; 替换为 !=（当 i 单调递增时语义等价）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2. 是否缺少断言？</strong></p>\n<p>测试执行了相关代码但没有验证关键输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 存活变异: price * quantity → price + quantity&#10;def test_calculate_total():&#10;    cart = Cart()&#10;    cart.add(item_a)  # 执行了但没断言结果&#10;    # 缺少: assert cart.total == expected_price\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 存活变异: price * quantity → price + quantity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_calculate_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Cart()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart.add(item_a)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 执行了但没断言结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 缺少: assert cart.total == expected_price</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>3. 是否缺少边界测试？</strong></p>\n<p>存在测试但没有覆盖变异暴露的边界条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 存活变异: x &gt;= 18 → x &gt; 18&#10;# 原测试只测了 age=25 和 age=10&#10;# 缺少: age=18 的边界测试&#10;def test_age_boundary():&#10;    assert is_adult(18) == True   # 杀死该变异&#10;    assert is_adult(17) == False\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 存活变异: x >= 18 → x > 18</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原测试只测了 age=25 和 age=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 缺少: age=18 的边界测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_age_boundary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_adult(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 杀死该变异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_adult(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">17</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>4. 是否缺少负路径测试？</strong></p>\n<p>只测试了正常路径，没有验证错误处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 存活变异: 删除 validate(input) 语句&#10;# 说明：没有测试验证 validate 的副作用/拒绝行为&#10;def test_invalid_input_rejected():&#10;    with pytest.raises(ValidationError):&#10;        process(invalid_input)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 存活变异: 删除 validate(input) 语句</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 说明：没有测试验证 validate 的副作用/拒绝行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_invalid_input_rejected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pytest.raises(ValidationError):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        process(invalid_input)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"从存活变异到测试改进的工作流\">从存活变异到测试改进的工作流</h2><p>系统化改进测试的流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[运行变异测试] --&gt; B[收集存活变异体]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按模块/文件分组]&#10;    C --&gt; D[对每个存活者]&#10;    D --&gt; E{等价变异体?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[标记为等价, 跳过]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[分析缺失的测试类型]&#10;    G --&gt; H[编写针对性测试]&#10;    H --&gt; I[重跑变异测试验证]&#10;    I --&gt; J{变异被杀死?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[改进有效]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[分析原因, 加强断言]&#10;    L --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[运行变异测试] --&gt; B[收集存活变异体]\n    B --&gt; C[按模块/文件分组]\n    C --&gt; D[对每个存活者]\n    D --&gt; E{等价变异体?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[标记为等价, 跳过]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[分析缺失的测试类型]\n    G --&gt; H[编写针对性测试]\n    H --&gt; I[重跑变异测试验证]\n    I --&gt; J{变异被杀死?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[改进有效]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[分析原因, 加强断言]\n    L --&gt; H</pre><p><strong>改进优先级排序原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>核心业务逻辑的存活者优先</strong>——这些代码的缺陷对用户影响最大</li>\n<li><strong>No Coverage 优先于 Survived</strong>——完全未测试比测试不够强更危险</li>\n<li><strong>高耦合模块优先</strong>——这些模块的 bug 可能级联影响</li>\n<li><strong>算术/条件变异优先于语句删除</strong>——前者更接近真实 bug 模式</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-中的变异测试门禁\">CI/CD 中的变异测试门禁</h2><p>将变异测试集成到 CI/CD 管道需要平衡精确性与速度：</p>\n<p><strong>PR 级别（增量）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 示例&#10;mutation-test:&#10;  runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;  steps:&#10;    - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      with:&#10;        fetch-depth: 0&#10;    - run: pnpm install&#10;    - run: pnpm stryker run --incremental&#10;    - name: Check mutation score threshold&#10;      run: |&#10;        SCORE=$(cat reports/mutation/mutation.json | jq &#39;.schemaVersion&#39; )&#10;        if [ &quot;$SCORE&quot; -lt 70 ]; then&#10;          echo &quot;Mutation score below threshold&quot;&#10;          exit 1&#10;        fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">mutation-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm stryker run --incremental</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check mutation score threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SCORE=$(cat reports/mutation/mutation.json | jq '.schemaVersion' )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        if [ \"$SCORE\" -lt 70 ]; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"Mutation score below threshold\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        fi</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>阈值策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>门禁类型</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>break</code> 阈值</td>\n<td>分数低于此值则构建失败</td>\n<td>防止严重退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>low</code> 阈值</td>\n<td>分数低于此值则标黄警告</td>\n<td>渐进改进信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>high</code> 阈值</td>\n<td>分数高于此值标绿</td>\n<td>激励目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异门禁</td>\n<td>新增代码的变异分数不低于 X</td>\n<td>渐进提升全局分数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变异测试的反模式\">变异测试的反模式</h2><p><strong>反模式 1：追求 100% 变异分数</strong></p>\n<p>这通常导致为等价变异体编写无意义的测试，或者写出过于脆弱的测试（对实现细节过度绑定）。90% 左右是大多数项目的合理上限。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式 2：变异测试作为唯一质量度量</strong></p>\n<p>变异测试度量&quot;测试能否检测微小改动&quot;，但不能替代：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>集成测试验证组件间交互</li>\n<li>属性测试发现意外行为</li>\n<li>代码审查检查设计问题</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>反模式 3：忽视执行时间管理</strong></p>\n<p>全量变异测试可能需要数小时。必须使用增量模式、并行执行、perTest 覆盖率分析等优化手段，否则变异测试会被团队放弃。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式 4：存活变异体全部归为&quot;测试缺陷&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>有些存活者暴露的是代码本身的问题——冗余逻辑、死代码。正确做法是先评估&quot;这个变异代表真实风险吗？&quot;，然后决定是加测试还是删代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变异测试与属性测试的协同\">变异测试与属性测试的协同</h2><p>属性测试天然具有高变异杀伤力——因为属性测试验证的是<em>所有输入</em>上的不变量，而变异操作产生的行为偏差很可能在某些输入上违反这些不变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 这个属性测试能杀死大多数排序相关变异&#10;@given(st.lists(st.integers()))&#10;def test_sort_ordered(xs):&#10;    result = sort(xs)&#10;    assert all(result[i] &lt;= result[i+1] for i in range(len(result)-1))&#10;    assert sorted(result) == result&#10;    assert len(result) == len(xs)&#10;    assert set(result) == set(xs)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 这个属性测试能杀死大多数排序相关变异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.lists(st.integers()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_sort_ordered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort(xs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>研究表明：一个精心编写的属性测试通常能杀死同等代码区域 5-10 个举例测试才能杀死的变异体数量。属性测试是提升变异分数最高效的途径之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>变异分数的正确解读需要区分存活变异体的类型——等价变异体、缺少断言、缺少边界测试、缺少负路径测试分别对应不同的改进动作。CI 门禁应采用增量策略（只要求新增代码达标）避免历史债务阻塞开发。属性测试与变异测试天然协同——属性测试验证的全称量化不变量能高效杀死大量变异体。警惕反模式：不追求 100%、不替代其他测试类型、不忽视执行时间管理。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 变异测试度量了测试的有效性；在实践中，将属性测试应用于有状态系统需要更高级的技术——状态机测试。见 <a href=\"../practice/stateful-testing\">状态机测试</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变异测试指标与改进策略","id":"变异测试指标与改进策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"变异测试的度量体系","id":"变异测试的度量体系"},{"level":2,"text":"变异分数的解读基准","id":"变异分数的解读基准"},{"level":2,"text":"存活变异体的分析方法","id":"存活变异体的分析方法"},{"level":2,"text":"从存活变异到测试改进的工作流","id":"从存活变异到测试改进的工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 中的变异测试门禁","id":"ci-cd-中的变异测试门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"变异测试的反模式","id":"变异测试的反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"变异测试与属性测试的协同","id":"变异测试与属性测试的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变异测试工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-tools"},"next":{"title":"状态机测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/stateful-testing"}}